From 3c2405a310e092af47bbd0cae0485871698a185c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 17:44:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/9] Access 9.2 A-6: the report queue, the icons, the F bar
 and the tooling

npc-reports.js sends failed and met uses together (one request every two
seconds, at most 20, no fail for a settled NPC, a forced state sync after a
plan global changes, one resend of a stale report) and hands answers to the
needs system; core/game.js installs it and restores npcFrustration after a
reload. The action icon shows blocked by tell (pulsing at 2) and work on a
visit; a held park shows no bubble; the debug overlay has an F bar;
window.__test.access gains work() and reports(); verify-run --access prints
npcFrustration.
